**Architecture & Environment Setup**
* [ ] Initialize repository structure and strictly add `.env` to `.gitignore` to protect API keys.
* [ ] Configure your web server and database schema for users, stored videos, and comments.
* [ ] Set up security middleware for input sanitization, form validation, and SQL/XSS prevention.
* [ ] Configure secure password hashing (Argon2 or bcrypt) for local authentication.

**Authentication & User Profiles**
* [x] Build local user registration (email, username, first name, last name, password).
* [ ] Implement token-based email password reset flow.
* [ ] Integrate 42 OmniAuth strategy alongside a second provider (e.g., GitHub or Google).
* [ ] Implement site-wide 1-click logout and language preference switcher (defaulting to English).
* [ ] Build editable user profile settings and public profile views (ensuring emails stay private).


**Torrent Engine & Video Streaming**
* [ ] Build custom background torrent client (strictly avoiding prohibited libraries like `webtorrent` or `peerflix`).
* [ ] Build non-blocking background downloading with sequential piece prioritisation.
* [ ] Implement on-the-fly transcoding via `ffmpeg` pipes for non-native browser formats (specifically `.mkv`).
* [ ] Set up automatic subtitle fetching (English + user's preferred language).
* [ ] Implement a scheduled cron task to purge downloaded movies unwatched for 30 days.


**Library & Player UI**
* [ ] Create responsive layout adhering to grid rules (Header, Main, Footer) supporting mobile screens.
* [ ] Integrate scrapers for at least 2 external torrent sources + IMDb/TMDb API for movie metadata.
* [ ] Build library view with infinite scroll, sorting/filtering (name, genre, rating, year), and watched/unwatched indicators.
* [ ] Build detailed video player page displaying cast, summary, player controls, and real-time user comments.


**RESTful API Implementation**
* [ ] Implement OAuth2 token route (`POST /oauth/token`).
* [ ] Implement User routes (`GET /users`, `GET /users/:id`, `PATCH /users/:id`).
* [ ] Implement Movie routes (`GET /movies`, `GET /movies/:id`).
* [ ] Implement Comment routes (`GET /comments`, `GET/PATCH/DELETE /comments/:id`, `POST /comments`).
* [ ] Configure explicit HTTP status error handling for invalid endpoints.


**Bonus Implementation**
* [ ] Build MediaStream / MSE browser API integration for dynamic video chunking.
* [ ] Implement dynamic multi-resolution streaming (480p, 720p, 1080p dynamically piped through `ffmpeg`).
* [ ] Add playback state retention ("Resume watching where you left off").
* [ ] Add extra OAuth2 strategies (Discord, Spotify, Twitch).